Subject: (off-topic) Spatial Capture-Recapture Workshop, Dec. 10-12, 2013 Patuxent Wildlife Research Center
Message-ID: <ayNzNAKwcpA.W4mDe0ifsswJ@unmarked.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/unmarked/c/ayNzNAKwcpA/m/W4mDe0ifsswJ>
